# tools/refiner/eval/source_v1.py
# Hand-written eval rows for the polish fine-tune (eval_v1). Each row: what the
# speaker says (spoken, read aloud by `say`) and the clean text (target). Targets
# only delete words from the spoken text, like the app's guard demands. Numbers are
# written as Parakeet writes them (digits), since the model sees Parakeet's text.
# build_eval.py turns these into eval_v1.jsonl through TTS, Parakeet and prepare().

